Approach

The application was designed as a lightweight proof-of-concept to demonstrate how AI-assisted workflows could support TTB compliance agents during alcohol label reviews.

The primary focus was on:

Creating a simple and accessible user interface for users with varying technical experience.
Simulating automated compliance verification workflows.
Providing fast local processing without requiring internet connectivity.
Demonstrating how repetitive verification tasks could be streamlined.

The prototype follows a desktop-based approach using Python and Tkinter to ensure ease of deployment and compatibility with restricted government environments.

