Assumptions

The following assumptions were made during development:

The application is intended as a proof-of-concept rather than a production-ready system.
Direct integration with the COLA system is outside the scope of this project.
Users manually enter application data for comparison.
Compliance agents remain responsible for final approval decisions.
Label images are uploaded for review but are not permanently stored.
Security, authentication, and FedRAMP compliance requirements are not required for the prototype.
Performance and usability were prioritized over advanced AI implementation due to project time constraints.
